{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:0.1", "PA_ja_208:0.2", "PA_ja_208:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Nataṁdaḷha Group (Nataṁdaḷhavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:0.4"], "en": "8. The Susumāra Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:1.1", "PA_ja_208:1.2"], "en": "“Enough for me with these mangoes, and with the rose-apples and breadfruits;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:1.3", "PA_ja_208:1.4", "PA_ja_208:2.1"], "en": "Better for me than the fig tree on the far side of the ocean is your great body indeed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:2.2"], "en": "\"And your wisdom is not equal to that [of the crocodile];", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:2.3"], "en": "you have been deceived, Susumāra.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:2.4"], "en": "Now go as you please.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_208:3.1"], "en": "The Susumāra-jātaka, the eighth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
